<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Linux - Tag | Boy's Life</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/linux/</link><description>独立开发者 Travis Bikkle 的个人博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.139.3 &amp; FixIt v0.3.15-fd15415b</generator><language>en</language><managingEditor>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</managingEditor><webMaster>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Dec 2024 13:38:44 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/linux/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Must do after fedora 41 installation</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/must-do-after-install-fedora-41/</link><pubDate>Fri, 29 Nov 2024 23:12:35 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/must-do-after-install-fedora-41/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;ol>
&lt;li>git ssh proxy&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">sudo dnf install connect-proxy&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">cat ~/.ssh/config 
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Host github.com
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> HostName ssh.github.com
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> User git
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ProxyCommand connect-proxy -S 127.0.0.1:7897 %h %p&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div></description></item><item><title>Vmware Freeze</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/2024/03/vmware-freeze/</link><pubDate>Wed, 06 Mar 2024 17:09:19 +0000</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/2024/03/vmware-freeze/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/en/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;h2 id="problem" class="heading-element">&lt;span>Problem&lt;/span>
